#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: review-bp-grps.php
msgid "Wbcom Designs - BuddyPress Group Reviews"
msgstr "Wbcom Designs - BuddyPress Group Reviews"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: review-bp-grps.php
msgid "https://wbcomdesigns.com/contact/"
msgstr "https://wbcomdesigns.com/contact/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: review-bp-grps.php
msgid ""
"This plugin allows BuddyPress Members to give reviews to BuddyPress groups "
"on the site. The review form allows users to give text reviews and even rate "
"the group based on multiple criteria."
msgstr ""
"Questo plugin consente ai Membri di BuddyPress di lasciare recensioni ai "
"gruppi di BuddyPress sul sito. Il modulo di recensione consente agli utenti "
"di lasciare recensioni testuali e di valutare il gruppo in base a più "
"criteri."

#. Author of the plugin
#: review-bp-grps.php
msgid "Wbcom Designs"
msgstr "Wbcom Designs"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: review-bp-grps.php
msgid "http://wbcomdesigns.com"
msgstr "http://wbcomdesigns.com"

#. translators: %1$s: plugin name (a brand, not translated).
#: admin/bgr-admin-feedback.php:213
#, php-format
msgid "Are you enjoying %1$s?"
msgstr "Ti stai divertendo con %1$s?"

#. translators: %1$s: plugin name.
#: admin/bgr-admin-feedback.php:217
#, php-format
msgid ""
"We hope you're enjoying %1$s! Could you please do us a BIG favor and give it "
"a 5-star rating on WordPress to help us spread the word and boost our "
"motivation?"
msgstr ""
"Speriamo che tu stia apprezzando %1$s! Potremmo chiederti un grande favore e "
"darci una valutazione a 5 stelle su WordPress per aiutarci a diffondere la "
"notizia e aumentare la nostra motivazione?"

